steam/apps/3732960/extras/f2387a4a09b9ba40c5de6d81a0571a2b.avif?t=1748023224\" width=620 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/e9d304ddd10044e9e8481dbf10e8f93d.poster.avif?t=1748023224\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/e9d304ddd10044e9e8481dbf10e8f93d.webm?t=1748023224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/e9d304ddd10044e9e8481dbf10e8f93d.mp4?t=1748023224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2696\ufe0f Product purchase prices change depending on the buying and selling activity at your facility. A product bought in bulk may become more expensive or yield less profit. You must strategically manage both your business and the economy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/f337ed7eed135d7d9b8faf709e3b696f.avif?t=1748023224\" width=620 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/6369bfa666e277d7fb0edb7be54282f4.poster.avif?t=1748023224\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/6369bfa666e277d7fb0edb7be54282f4.webm?t=1748023224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/6369bfa666e277d7fb0edb7be54282f4.mp4?t=1748023224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Gain experience through tasks like customer service, cleaning, and product management to level up. Leveling up allows you to acquire sales licenses for new products and purchase new businesses like supermarkets and car washes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each business has its own unique upgrades: Buy new pumps, order security cameras, invest in a generator to stay open even during bad weather.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/d6009df8d681ce39473056b7374b56ce.avif?t=1748023224\" width=620 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/74538c07d82f20cdda424c4aa0c9a8f0.poster.avif?t=1748023224\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/74538c07d82f20cdda424c4aa0c9a8f0.webm?t=1748023224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732960/extras/74538c07d82f20cdda424c4aa0c9a8f0.mp4?t=1748023224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every day brings a different story at the rest area:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Heavy rains can cause power outages \u2014 no problem if you have a generator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc9 Economic fluctuations can reverse product prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Unexpected malfunctions will test your resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No day is the same at Oriseus Rest Area.</p>",
